      ],
      "details": "Move the fromEnvelope and toEnvelope fields, the getEnvelope(Coordinate, int) helper, and the isCloseToStartOrEnd(Vertex) geometry logic into the new same-package helper. Keep isCloseToStartOrEnd(Vertex) on RouteRequest as a compatibility wrapper delegating with the existing from and to locations. This removes RouteRequest's direct references to Coordinate, Envelope, and SphericalDistanceLibrary; those references remain in RouteRequestProximity. RouteRequest gains one dependency on RouteRequestProximity, giving an estimated net Fan-Out reduction of two.",
      "risk": "medium"
    },
    {
