        "src/main/java/org/opentripplanner/routing/api/request/RouteRequestProximity.java"
      ],
      "details": "Remove Coordinate, Envelope, and SphericalDistanceLibrary imports from RouteRequest once the fields and geometry calculation are moved, and add them to RouteRequestProximity. Retain GenericLocation and Vertex references in RouteRequest because they are still used by the wrapper and existing public API.",
